{"sha":"5f02f5e78ec9688e29b6857813185b1181796abe","node_id":"C_kwDOACN7MtoAKDVmMDJmNWU3OGVjOTY4OGUyOWI2ODU3ODEzMTg1YjExODE3OTZhYmU","commit":{"author":{"name":"Akhil P Oommen","email":"quic_akhilpo@quicinc.com","date":"2025-04-19T14:51:31Z"},"committer":{"name":"Rob Clark","email":"robdclark@chromium.org","date":"2025-05-04T16:20:29Z"},"message":"drm/msm/a6xx: Increase HFI response timeout\n\nWhen ACD feature is enabled, it triggers some internal calibrations\nwhich result in a pretty long delay during the first HFI perf vote.\nSo, increase the HFI response timeout to match the downstream driver.\n\nSigned-off-by: Akhil P Oommen <quic_akhilpo@quicinc.com>\nTested-by: Maya Matuszczyk <maccraft123mc@gmail.com>\nTested-by: Anthony Ruhier <aruhier@mailbox.org>\nPatchwork: https://patchwork.freedesktop.org/patch/649344/\nSigned-off-by: Rob Clark <robdclark@chromium.org>","tree":{"sha":"f67d6fe16a8da68aa93404b4964608b86b029cca","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/torvalds/linux/git/trees/f67d6fe16a8da68aa93404b4964608b86b029cca"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/torvalds/linux/git/commits/5f02f5e78ec9688e29b6857813185b1181796abe","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/torvalds/linux/commits/5f02f5e78ec9688e29b6857813185b1181796abe","html_url":"https://github.com/torvalds/linux/commit/5f02f5e78ec9688e29b6857813185b1181796abe","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/torvalds/linux/commits/5f02f5e78ec9688e29b6857813185b1181796abe/comments","author":null,"committer":{"login":"robclark","id":48820,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODIw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/48820?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/robclark","html_url":"https://github.com/robclark","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robclark/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robclark/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"htt